      },
      "body": "`launcher_helper` always exits 0, so under `--launcher mpich` a rank that crashes or is killed is reported as a success.\n\n**Cause:** it waits for the user script and then returns normally, and `mpirun` only sees the helper's exit status.\n\n**Fix:** exit with the script's return code when it is not zero.\n\n**Not a duplicate:** no open or closed PR or issue covers it (searched `launcher_helper exit code`, `launcher_helper returncode`).\n\n**Test:** `pytest tests/unit/launcher/test_launcher_helper.py -q` on CPU only (macOS, no mpich): the new `test_launcher_helper_propagates_exit_code` fails before (`DID NOT RAISE SystemExit`) and passes after. Not covered: a real MPICH launch, GPU, ZeRO.",
